    imageAlt: "Portrait of a homeowner",
    project: "Whole-home control",
  },
  {
    quote:
      "From the first drawings to the final handover, every part of the process felt considered. The lighting and shades have changed how we use the house every day.",
    client: "NOVA homeowner",
    location: "Hampstead renovation",
    image:
      "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85",
    imageAlt: "Portrait of a homeowner",
    project: "Lighting & shading",
  },
  {
